      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the wall IS collapsing. i can feel it. it's not a metaphor, it's just the truth of my life. everything i do just feels like i'm delaying the end. if the end is already written in the dna, isn't all this effort just adding more unnecessary pain to the process? it feels like i'm just prolonging the suffering for no reason.",
